    <div>
      <p style="align-items: center; color: var(--co-green); display: flex; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 0.875rem; gap: 4px; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 8px; text-transform: none">
        <svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-zap" fill="none" height="11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="11" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z" />
        </svg>
        "Kto miał kartę?"
